{"book":13,"chapter":50,"rubric":"PYTHON AS A FIRST LANGUAGE / PROJECTS AND TOOLING / CHAPTER 50","slides":[{"title":"From file to project","sub":"What a project is","short":"Project","main":"A project: modules, dependencies, tests and a way to run it.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Script","Project","What to know"],"captions":["So far: single files","A project: several modules, other libraries, tests, settings, a version and a way to run it","How packages work, how to isolate dependencies and pin their versions, and uv ties it all together"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"lines":["script.py"],"lang":"python","size":16.0,"lh":30.0,"w":160.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"b0","x":62.0,"y":54.0,"w":104.0,"h":26.0,"text":"modules","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b1","x":180.0,"y":54.0,"w":104.0,"h":26.0,"text":"dependencies","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b2","x":298.0,"y":54.0,"w":104.0,"h":26.0,"text":"tests","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b3","x":62.0,"y":94.0,"w":104.0,"h":26.0,"text":"settings","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b4","x":180.0,"y":94.0,"w":104.0,"h":26.0,"text":"version","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b5","x":298.0,"y":94.0,"w":104.0,"h":26.0,"text":"running","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":56.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"packages","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":56.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"environments","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":290.0,"y":56.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"lock","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"u","x":180.0,"y":108.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"uv","tone":"yellow","size":14.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[17.1,29.4]}]},{"title":"Modules and packages","sub":"Imports and sys.path","short":"Packages","main":"python -m handles packages correctly.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Package","Imports","sys.path"],"captions":["A module is a file, a package is a directory of modules; __init__.py gathers the public interface","Absolute imports start at the package root, relative ones use dots; if __name__ == '__main__' makes a file both library and program","Modules are found via the sys.path list; python -m package.module handles packages correctly"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":40.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["shop/","    __init__.py","    cart.py","    pricing.py","    utils/","        __init__.py"],"hl":[0],"lang":"python","size":12.0,"lh":22.0,"w":240.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["from shop.cart import Cart      # absolute","from .pricing import total      # relative","if __name__ == '__main__': main()"],"hl":[2],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":28.0,"w":330.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"script dir","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"site-packages","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"standard","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":116.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":226.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":244.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"text":"python -m shop.cli","tone":"green","size":10.5}]],"cues":[15.1,28.7]}]},{"title":"Project structure","sub":"src layout and pyproject","short":"Structure","main":"One pyproject.toml instead of many files.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["src layout","pyproject.toml","One file"],"captions":["Root: project description and tests/, the package itself is in src/: tests check the installed package","pyproject.toml holds name, version, requires-python, dependencies, entry points and tool settings","One file instead of setup.py, requirements.txt and setup.cfg"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":40.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["project/","    pyproject.toml","    README.md","    src/shop/","    tests/"],"hl":[3],"lang":"python","size":12.0,"lh":24.0,"w":240.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":24.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["[project]","name = 'shop'","version = '0.3.0'","requires-python = '>=3.12'","dependencies = ['httpx>=0.27']"],"hl":[3,4],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":330.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":"setup.py","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":100.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":"requirements.txt","tone":"muted","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":270.0,"y":80.0,"w":130.0,"h":36.0,"text":"pyproject.toml","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":156.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":74.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":156.0,"y1":100.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":86.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[14.2,23.5]}]},{"title":"Virtual environments","sub":"Isolation","short":"Environments","main":"Project libraries stay out of system Python.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Conflict","Environment","Reproducibility"],"captions":["In system Python projects conflict: one needs version 2, another needs version 3","A virtual environment is a directory with its own interpreter and packages: python -m venv .venv; pip installs only there","The environment stays out of the repository: a dependency file describes the project and recreates it; never install into system Python"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":56.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"project A: v2","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":70.0,"y":100.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"project B: v3","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":270.0,"y":78.0,"w":120.0,"h":36.0,"text":"system: one version","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":116.0,"y1":56.0,"x2":210.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":116.0,"y1":100.0,"x2":210.0,"y2":86.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":56.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":".venv\nA: library v2","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":56.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":".venv\nB: library v3","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"text":"each has its own packages","size":10.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":120.0,"h":30.0,"text":"pyproject","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":120.0,"h":30.0,"text":".venv","tone":"yellow","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":214.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":116.0,"text":".venv not in git","size":10.0}]],"cues":[11.3,27.1]}]},{"title":"uv","sub":"A modern manager","short":"uv","main":"uv add, uv run, uv sync.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["One tool","Commands","This course"],"captions":["uv is a project manager in Rust: it replaces creating the project and environment, installing, locking and installing Python versions","uv init, uv add, uv run, uv sync are the main commands","This course is built with uv too: the backend starts with uv run, the environment is created and updated by itself"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"u","x":180.0,"y":40.0,"w":100.0,"h":28.0,"text":"uv","tone":"yellow","size":15.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b0","x":56.0,"y":110.0,"w":56.0,"h":26.0,"text":"project","tone":"green","size":7.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b1","x":118.0,"y":110.0,"w":56.0,"h":26.0,"text":"environment","tone":"green","size":7.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b2","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"w":56.0,"h":26.0,"text":"install","tone":"green","size":7.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b3","x":242.0,"y":110.0,"w":56.0,"h":26.0,"text":"lock","tone":"green","size":7.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b4","x":304.0,"y":110.0,"w":56.0,"h":26.0,"text":"Python","tone":"green","size":7.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["uv init shop","uv add httpx","uv run pytest","uv sync --frozen"],"lang":"python","size":12.5,"lh":26.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["cd backend","uv run uvicorn app.main:app"],"hl":[1],"lang":"python","size":12.0,"lh":30.0,"w":300.0}]],"cues":[18.4,33.1]}]},{"title":"Versions and locking","sub":"Reproducibility","short":"Lock","main":"The lock file pins exact versions.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Conditions","Direct and transitive","Lock file"],"captions":["Version conditions: >=, <, ==, ~= (compatible release): a lower bound and a cautious upper one","Direct dependencies you chose, transitive ones came along inside them: too many to control by hand","The lock file pins exact versions and checksums of all packages: the build is reproducible"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":40.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["httpx>=0.27","httpx>=0.27,<1.0","httpx~=0.27.2    # >=0.27.2, ==0.27.*","httpx==0.27.2"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":26.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"httpx","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":70.0,"y":100.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"anyio","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":200.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"certifi","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":300.0,"y":100.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"idna","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":70.0,"y1":54.0,"x2":70.0,"y2":90.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":106.0,"y1":50.0,"x2":168.0,"y2":64.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["uv.lock","httpx 0.27.2   sha256:…","anyio 4.4.0    sha256:…","certifi 2024.8  sha256:…"],"hl":[0],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":26.0,"w":300.0}]],"cues":[11.5,28.2]}]},{"title":"Groups and extras","sub":"Development dependencies","short":"Groups","main":"Production and development dependencies are kept apart.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Development groups","Extras","requires-python"],"captions":["Tests, linters and formatters go into dependency groups: installed only for developers","Optional library features are extras: pip install 'shop[postgres]'","requires-python forbids installing into an incompatible interpreter; uv can download the right Python itself"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":28.0,"text":"dependencies","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":90.0,"y":100.0,"w":130.0,"h":28.0,"text":"group: dev","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":"production","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":270.0,"y":100.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":"development only","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":156.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":60.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":156.0,"y1":100.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":100.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["[project.optional-dependencies]","postgres = ['psycopg>=3']","pip install 'shop[postgres]'"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":28.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["requires-python = '>=3.12'","uv python install 3.13","uv run --python 3.13 pytest"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"python","size":11.5,"lh":28.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[12.7,22.1]}]},{"title":"Build and publish","sub":"wheel, PyPI, versions","short":"Publishing","main":"A wheel is a ready-to-install file.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Wheel and sdist","Publishing","Versions"],"captions":["uv build makes distributions: a source archive (sdist) and a wheel, ready to install without running build code","Publish to PyPI: uv publish or twine, preferably with trusted publishing and no stored passwords","Semantic versioning: major is incompatible, minor is new features, patch is fixes"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":30.0,"text":"project","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":50.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"sdist","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":94.0,"w":90.0,"h":24.0,"text":"wheel","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":300.0,"y":70.0,"w":70.0,"h":30.0,"text":"uv build","tone":"muted","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":116.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":52.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":116.0,"y1":78.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":92.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"wheel","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":120.0,"h":30.0,"text":"PyPI","tone":"yellow","size":13.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":142.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":210.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"b0","x":70.0,"y":60.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"2 · major","tone":"red","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b1","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"3 · minor","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b2","x":290.0,"y":60.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"4 · patch","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"text":"2.3.4","size":14.0}]],"cues":[13.5,26.6]}]},{"title":"Running","sub":"Entry points and settings","short":"Running","main":"Secrets stay out of the repository.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Entry points","Settings","Secrets"],"captions":["[project.scripts] defines a command: shop = 'shop.cli:main': once installed, it appears in the environment","Settings that differ, like database address and debug mode, are read from environment variables","Secrets are not kept in code or the repository; the file with local values is excluded from version control"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["[project.scripts]","shop = 'shop.cli:main'","# after install: the shop command"],"hl":[1],"lang":"python","size":11.5,"lh":28.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["DEBUG = os.environ.get('DEBUG') == '1'","PORT = int(os.environ.get('PORT', '8000'))"],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":30.0,"w":330.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":110.0,"h":28.0,"text":".env","tone":"yellow","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":".gitignore","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"text":"keys stay out of the repo","tone":"red","size":10.5}]],"cues":[13.4,21.6]}]},{"title":"Checks in a project","sub":"Hooks and CI","short":"Checks","main":"CI repeats the commands in a clean environment.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Settings in pyproject","Hooks","CI"],"captions":["pytest, linter and type checker settings live in pyproject; run with uv run pytest","Pre-commit hooks format and check the code automatically","Continuous integration repeats the same commands in a clean environment on several Python versions"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["[tool.pytest.ini_options]","testpaths = ['tests']","[tool.ruff]","line-length = 100"],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":26.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"commit","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"hooks","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"into history","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":112.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":134.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":226.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":250.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"v0","x":70.0,"y":60.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Python 3.12","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"v1","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Python 3.13","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"v2","x":290.0,"y":60.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"Python 3.14","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":110.0,"text":"clean environment","size":10.5}]],"cues":[11.6,19.0]}]},{"title":"Security","sub":"Supply chain","short":"Security","main":"Every dependency is someone else's code.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Other's code","Pin","Fewer dependencies"],"captions":["Every dependency is someone else's code that runs on your machine; check names: typo packages exist","Lock versions and checksums, update deliberately, audit against known vulnerabilities","No dependency for one function, no unverified install scripts as administrator"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":"requests","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":120.0,"h":28.0,"text":"reqeusts ✗","tone":"red","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"text":"typo package","tone":"red","size":10.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":30.0,"text":"uv.lock","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"pip-audit","tone":"yellow","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"dependency","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":130.0,"h":30.0,"text":"ten lines of code","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[14.2,28.3]}]},{"title":"Container","sub":"A reproducible image","short":"Container","main":"Dependencies in a separate layer.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Base","Layers","Not as admin"],"captions":["The image takes a lightweight base with the right Python version and copies in the lock file","Install from the frozen lock before copying code: they change less often and cache as a separate layer","Run as an ordinary user: the image is reproducible, small and runs the same everywhere"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["FROM python:3.13-slim","COPY pyproject.toml uv.lock ./"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"python","size":11.5,"lh":30.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["RUN uv sync --frozen","COPY src ./src      # code comes after"],"hl":[0],"lang":"python","size":11.5,"lh":30.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["USER app","CMD ['uv', 'run', 'shop']"],"hl":[0],"lang":"python","size":12.0,"lh":30.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[16.0,22.1]}]},{"title":"Summary","sub":"Projects and tooling","short":"Summary","main":"Packages, environments, lock, uv.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Packages","Environments","uv","Security"],"captions":["Modules → packages → a project with pyproject.toml and src layout","A virtual environment isolates dependencies; a lock pins versions","uv creates, installs, runs, builds; entry points give a command, settings come from the environment","Tests and a linter in CI, care with other people's code"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"module","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"package","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":28.0,"text":"project","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":